Hello,

Reporting a regression in kvm-unit-tests on an AMD EPYC host running 
KVM. The ./svm test fails on current master (from 8d37abbf onward) with 
the same host kernel and QEMU that pass when the suite is pinned to an 
older revision.


Recreation steps:

git clone --depth 1 -b master 
https://gitlab.com/kvm-unit-tests/kvm-unit-tests.git
cd kvm-unit-tests
./configure --arch=x86_64
make standalone
export QEMU=/path/to/qemu-system-x86_64   # KVM enabled
./x86-run ./x86/svm.flat -smp 2 -append -pause_filter_test -cpu max,+svm 
-m 4g


Result (fails on current master, or 8d37abbf and later)


FAIL: V_IRQ did not fire
FAIL: virq_inject_within_shadow
FAIL: Test EFLAGS.TF on VMRUN: trap expected after completion of first 
guest instruction
SUMMARY: 331 tests, 3 unexpected failures, 4 skipped

Attaching full run log here.

Happy to provide any further logs/information if required.

Thanks,

Srikanth Aithal




